179,18180,18181,18182,18183,18184,18185,18186,18187,18188,18189,18190,18191,18192,18193,18194,18195,18196,18197,18198,18199,18200,18201,18202,18203,18204,18205,18206,18207,18208,18209],"revision_id":2645530},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-075-hanbo:p003:m0000","surface":"王坦之","start":0,"end":3,"person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-hanbo:p003:m0012","surface":"袁宏","start":12,"end":14,"person_id":"yin_215_w6q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-hanbo:p003:m0020","surface":"伯","start":20,"end":21,"person_id":"al7_2l9_13l","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-075-hanbo","book_id":"b-jinshu-075","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-075-hanbo-ws2645530"},{"id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p011","text":"浩雖被黜放，口無怨言，夷神委命，談詠不輟，雖家人不見其有流放之戚。但終日書空，作「咄咄怪事」四字而已。浩甥韓伯，浩素賞愛之，隨至徙所，經歲還都，浩送至渚側，詠曹顏遠詩云：「富貴他人合，貧賤親戚離。」因而泣下。後溫將以浩為尚書令，遺書告之，浩欣然許焉。將答書，慮有謬誤，開閉者數十，竟達空函，大忤溫意，由是遂絕。永和十二年卒。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p011:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"浩","kind":"person","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整敘事／引語主語逐段辨識；原字不校改。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p011:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整敘事／引語主語逐段辨識；原字不校改。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p011:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"浩","kind":"person","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整敘事／引語主語逐段辨識；原字不校改。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p011:m0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"甥","kind":"person","person_id":"al7_2l9_13l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原詞 generic甥；不確定母系，不套舅甥模型。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p011:m0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"韓伯","kind":"person","person_id":"al7_2l9_13l","status":"